+# SOC2 / ISO Audit Playbook
+
+This playbook describes steps to prepare for an independent SOC2/ISO audit using Aegis artifacts.
+
+1) Prepare evidence
+ - Run enterprise acceptance one-click to produce signed auditor bundle.
+ - Ensure SBOMs, grype results, HIL evidence, FL evidence, signed PoA bundles and Rekor entries are present.
+ - Produce manifest via ops/compliance/generate_signed_audit_manifest.py
+
+2) Upload & share
+ - Upload bundles to S3 with restricted access.
+ - Provide Rekor transparency log IDs for all signed artifacts.
+
+3) Engagement
+ - Provide auditor with threat model, policies, incident playbooks, and evidence S3 URIs.
+ - Schedule replay runs as requested by auditor (HIL replays, validator runs).
+
+4) Remediation
+ - Triage auditor findings; produce remediation evidence and updated signed bundles.
